<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Israel Chem.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Israel Chem.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel Chemicals Ltd, the country's largest chemicals group, was rated &quot;outperform&quot; as Lehman Brothers started coverage of the stock on Tuesday, the investment bank said.</p>
<p>Analyst Elise Horowitz said the company should achieve 27-percent earnings-per-share growth in the next three years.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
